# Build context is the repository root. Allow-list only what images need: the VM
# copy of the repo holds tens of GB of health datasets in ml/data/raw, which must
# never be sent to the Docker daemon or end up in an image.
*
!services/
!frontend/
!infra/gateway/
!ml/__init__.py
!ml/data/__init__.py
!ml/data/loaders.py
!ml/features/
!ml/models/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
